Well, the first thing I always wish for (if I dont have any already) is:
MINI-SPOILER - HIT N NOW OR BE DOOMED

"3 blessed scrolls of charging".

Then wish for whatever else you want, and when your wand runs out,
just charge 'er up again (though you'll only get one more wish, I
belive - and I don't think you can recharge more than once on a WOW).
This is useful because it basically gets you two free scrolls of
charging, plus whatever you wish for.  

Beware - this was true on older versions of nethack - I am unsure if
it works this way on the newer versions, which I have just started
playing.

